   "stem_html": "Jack and Jill go to a local farmers market to purchase some fruit. Jack buys 3 peaches and 2 limes, which cost $1.50; Jill buys 6 peaches and 5 limes, which cost $3.45. What is the cost of a peach? What is the cost of a lime?",
